    "title": "Murder suspect headed back to criminal court - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Perry Smith ,\n36 minutes ago Criminal proceedings were reinstated against a San Fernando Valley man accused in the shooting death of a College of the Canyons student last year. Grigor Hovsepyan, a 23-year-old Granada Hills man, has pleaded not guilty after he was held to answer to a murder charge in the May 2024 shooting death of Gabriel Unzueta. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
